  "title": {
    "rendered": "Container Offices for Sale in Central Delhi"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "<p>Looking for a container office in Central Delhi? SAMAN Portable is a direct manufacturer of steel-framed container offices supplied across Delhi NCR, including Connaught Place, Karol Bagh, Paharganj and the surrounding commercial belt. We build each unit at our factory and deliver it ready to use, so you skip the cost and delay of on-site civil construction in one of the most space-constrained parts of the city.</p>\n\n<h2>Container Offices for Sale in Central Delhi</h2>\n<p>A container office is a factory-built steel cabin you can place, use and relocate without permanent foundations. For Central Delhi businesses dealing with high rents and limited plots, it gives you a sales counter, admin office or service desk that arrives finished and works from day one. SAMAN supplies 10ft, 20ft and 40ft units built on an MS steel frame and finished to your layout.</p>\n\n<h2>Container office sizes we supply</h2>\n<p>We manufacture three standard footprints and customise the internal layout, doors, windows, wiring and partitions to suit the use.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr><th>Size</th><th>Typical use</th><th>Fit-out</th></tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>10ft</td><td>Single-desk office, sales booth, guard or supervisor cabin</td><td>Door, window, lighting, power points</td></tr>\n<tr><td>20ft</td><td>Team office for 4–6, site office, help desk</td><td>AC provision, partitions, storage, workstations</td></tr>\n<tr><td>40ft</td><td>Larger office, meeting room + workspace, multi-cabin layout</td><td>Multiple rooms, washroom provision, networking</td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Units are built on an MS steel frame to IS 2062, with insulated wall and roof panels for comfort in Delhi summers and winters. Stackable and relocatable layouts are available where access allows.</p>\n\n<h2>Why buy your container office direct from SAMAN</h2>\n<p>SAMAN POS India Private Limited is a manufacturer, not a reseller or directory listing. Buying direct means the price, build and after-sales support all sit with one company.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Factory-built quality:</strong> MS steel frame to IS 2062; SAMAN holds ISO 9001:2015 certification.</li>\n<li><strong>Backed warranty:</strong> 5 years structural frame and base + 1–2 years finishing + 20–25 years engineered service life.</li>\n<li><strong>Clear logistics:</strong> delivery from ₹3,000 and typical transit of 3–5 days, with returns accepted within 7 days of delivery/installation.</li>\n<li><strong>Made to your use:</strong> office, sales, security or site-management layouts, customised before dispatch.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Delivery and installation in Central Delhi</h2>\n<p>We deliver finished container offices across Central Delhi and the wider NCR from our North India manufacturing unit. Units arrive built, so installation on a prepared, level surface is quick and there is no extended on-site construction. Because the cabin is structurally complete, it can be repositioned or moved to another site later as your requirement changes — useful for campaign, project and temporary-office needs in busy commercial zones.</p>\n\n<h2>Get a container office quote in Central Delhi</h2>\n<p>Tell us the size, layout and where the unit needs to go, and we will share current pricing and lead time. Pricing depends on size, fit-out and delivery distance, so we quote against your actual requirement rather than a fixed list. <a href=\"https://www.samanportable.com/product/container-offices\">See our container office range</a> to start.</p>\n<p><strong>Call +91 88616 22859</strong> or use <strong>Send Enquiry</strong> for a quote and delivery estimate to your Central Delhi location.</p>\n\n<h2>FAQs</h2>\n<br>\n<h3>What sizes of container office can I buy in Central Delhi?</h3>\n<p>We supply 10ft, 20ft and 40ft container offices and customise the internal layout. The 10ft suits a single desk or sales booth, the 20ft a small team, and the 40ft a larger office with separate rooms.</p>\n<br>\n<h3>How long does delivery to Central Delhi take?</h3>\n<p>Units are factory-built and typically reach Delhi NCR sites within a 3–5 day transit window after the order and layout are confirmed. Delivery starts from ₹3,000 depending on distance and access.</p>\n<br>\n<h3>Can the container office be customised before delivery?</h3>\n<p>Yes. We fit doors, windows, electricals, partitions, washroom provision and storage to your plan at the factory, so the unit arrives ready to use.</p>\n<br>\n<h3>Is there a warranty?</h3>\n<p>Yes — 5 years on the structural frame and base, 1–2 years on finishing, and a 20–25 year engineered service life. The 20–25 years is the engineered life of the structure, not a warranty period.</p>\n<br>\n<h3>Do you sell new or used container offices?</h3>\n<p>New only. Every container office is manufactured fresh on an MS steel frame to IS 2062. We do not supply second-hand or refurbished units.</p>\n<br>\n<h3>How do I get a price for my Central Delhi requirement?</h3>\n<p>Call +91 88616 22859 or use Send Enquiry with your size, layout and location. We quote against your actual requirement and share the delivery estimate.</p>",
    "protected": false
  },
